      "content": "i get the caution but i'm already pretty sure i'm deficient cuz i've read about it and my energy is just trashed. i don't really have time for a doctor's appointment right now, i just need to fix this. if i take the 100mg once a day but maybe take it with some vitamin C to help absorption, would that make it more effective? like, is there a specific way to stack it to make sure it works as fast as possible?",
