      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i totally respect that but i'm just not in a position to go to the doctor right now. i've seen people online doing way higher than 100mg to \"load\" their levels. if i wanted to do a serious loading phase to really jumpstart my energy, what would be a reasonable aggressive dose to aim for? like if i wanted to really push it for the first two weeks to get my levels up fast, what's the upper limit i should stay under?",
